  "job_B9.5.2_20251003_115017": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00fe\u00e6t heo h\u00e6fde henna & fedde in \u00feam ingange hire huses. Ac \u00fea hire afyrrde & bereafode an fox, se com geneahhe naht feorran. \u00dea sume d\u00e6ge stod Bonefacius se cniht in \u00feam ilcan ingange; \u00fea com se fox, swa his \u00feeaw w\u00e6s, & & he \u00fea sona swy\u00fee hra\u00f0e gearn to cyrican & astrehte hine sylfne on gebede & mid openum Geseoh nu, \u00fe\u00e6t se fox eta\u00f0 \u00fea henne, \u00fee heo fedde. \u00dea aras he of his gebede & eode ut of \u00fe\u00e6re cyrcan. \u00dea sona gecyrde se fox & forlet \u00fea henne, \u00fee he in his mu\u00f0e h\u00e6fde, & he \u00fea sweltende gefeoll on Petrus cw\u00e6\u00f0: swi\u00f0e wundorlic is \u00fe\u00e6t, \u00fe\u00e6t God hine ge\u00e6admoda\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t he gehyre\u00f0 \u00feara bene, \u00fee Gregorius him andswarode: \u00feis w\u00e6s gedon, Petrus, of mycelre stihtunge ures scyppendes, \u00fe\u00e6t we So\u00f0lice hit w\u00e6s gehyred in \u00feam yfellicum \u00feingum, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fees cniht w\u00e6s halig & bylwytte, to \u00fean Petrus cw\u00e6\u00f0: wel me lica\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu cwi\u00f0st. Gregorius him andswarode: sum swi\u00fee arwyr\u00f0es lifes wer w\u00e6s on \u00feam ylcan d\u00e6lum, \u00feam w\u00e6s Se w\u00e6s \u00feeonde & weaxende on unm\u00e6tre gife gastlicra m\u00e6gna to \u00feon swi\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fea uncl\u00e6nan & he w\u00e6s geornfull mid teolone his singalra gebeda \u00feem ang\u00e6n gesettum deofla m\u00e6nigum, \u00fee Eac sum wer w\u00e6s \u00feissere ylcan cy",
